Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Shot,,0,0,0,,S00  Before the audio starts (about 2 s of room tone, added in the edit)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S01  Downbeat, before the first line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:08.34,Shot,,0,0,0,,S02  "Hi, grown-ups! Today we're learning how an opt-out works." (regenerated)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:11.85,Shot,,0,0,0,,S03  "Say hello to Little Switch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:18.56,Shot,,0,0,0,,S04  V01 "Hi! I've got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:22.08,Shot,,0,0,0,,S05  "You typed a little question…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S06  "And an answer hopped on top of it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:28.96,Shot,,0,0,0,,S07  V02 "That's neat, but what if I would rather read the page myself?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:33.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S08  "Well, there's a tiny tab marked 'Web'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:36.63,Shot,,0,0,0,,S09  V03 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:38.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S10  "You push me down for off…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:38.43,Shot,,0,0,0,,S11  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.41,Shot,,0,0,0,,S12  "…so how'd I just return?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:43.49,Shot,,0,0,0,,S13  "Default on! Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:47.05,Shot,,0,0,0,,S14  "It was there when you woke up…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.05,0:00:50.63,Shot,,0,0,0,,S15  "You can hide it, you can mute it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:54.23,Shot,,0,0,0,,S16  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:57.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,S17  "Default on!" / V04 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:01.42,Shot,,0,0,0,,S18  Flute and scat fill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:09.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S19  "Now, 'opt-in' means somebody asks you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.16,0:01:15.95,Shot,,0,0,0,,S20  V05 "And 'opt-out' means that no one asked you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:21.47,Shot,,0,0,0,,S21  "And 'default' is the setting that they picked…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:23.09,Shot,,0,0,0,,S22  "…they'll say you picked the same."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:28.03,Shot,,0,0,0,,S23  "Got that? Opt-in, opt-out, default. There'll be a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:30.34,Shot,,0,0,0,,S24  V06 "There's always a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:34.42,Shot,,0,0,0,,S25  "Now your inbox got a helper…" (replaced)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:38.36,Shot,,0,0,0,,S26  "A lawsuit says it flipped itself last fall…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S27  V07 "And what's the company say?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:45.09,Shot,,0,0,0,,S28  "That they didn't, and here's the door: / Just a menu, then a menu…" (replaced
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:48.57,Shot,,0,0,0,,S29  "Then the TV got an update in the middle of the night,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:51.97,Shot,,0,0,0,,S30  "And a brand-new tile was waiting…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.31,Shot,,0,0,0,,S31  V08 "Can I delete it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:54.55,Shot,,0,0,0,,S32  "You can hide it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:57.05,Shot,,0,0,0,,S33  V09 "Is that the same?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:01:59.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S34  "…Next verse!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:04.78,Shot,,0,0,0,,S35  V10 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.02,Shot,,0,0,0,,S36  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:17.23,Shot,,0,0,0,,S37  Chorus 2, first three lines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:21.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S38  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.21,Shot,,0,0,0,,S39  V11 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:28.06,Shot,,0,0,0,,S40  "Pop quiz!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:31.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S41  "There's a blue ring in the chat app…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.58,Shot,,0,0,0,,S42  V12 "I'll uninstall it!" / "Nope!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.68,Shot,,0,0,0,,S43  V13 "I'll mute it, then?" / "That's not so bad!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:38.79,Shot,,0,0,0,,S44  "Now your phone has got an update…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:42.93,Shot,,0,0,0,,S45  V14 "Where's the 'No'?" / "There isn't one!…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:46.39,Shot,,0,0,0,,S46  "In Australia, office software went up forty-five percent…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:49.86,Shot,,0,0,0,,S47  V15 "Was there one without the robot?" / "Only once you tried to leave!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:53.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S48  "Now the school's the place for learning…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:57.24,Shot,,0,0,0,,S49  "So the school said, 'No AI, please'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:03:00.69,Shot,,0,0,0,,S50  "And the giant said, 'We hear you!'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:04.42,Shot,,0,0,0,,S51  "Take the robot with your search, or else there's no search there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:07.26,Shot,,0,0,0,,S52  [record scratch, tape rewind]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:13.48,Shot,,0,0,0,,S53  "Correction, boys and girls!…" ("Ahem!" isn't sung)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.86,Shot,,0,0,0,,S54  V16 "And the answer box on top?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S55  "…That one's 'deeply integrated.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.00,Shot,,0,0,0,,S56  V17 "What's that mean?" / "It means it stays."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:37.99,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57  Final chorus, through the second-to-last line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:39.88,Shot,,0,0,0,,S58  Last "Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.32,Shot,,0,0,0,,S59  V18 "I've got two sides."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.90,Shot,,0,0,0,,S60  [click] [click] [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:46.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,S61  "…Guess one of 'em was just for show."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:52.32,Shot,,0,0,0,,S62  "And that's how an opt-out works! Join us next week…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:55.55,Shot,,0,0,0,,S63  [pop-up chime] / "Who asked for that?" ("Huh." isn't sung)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:59.08,Shot,,0,0,0,,S64  V19 "Hey, who wrote this song, anyway?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.46,Shot,,0,0,0,,S65  "An AI did."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.10,Shot,,0,0,0,,S66  "…But somebody asked it to."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:06.10,Shot,,0,0,0,,S67  V21 "Hey… was its switch on, too?" over the band's last bars, then the audio e
